      "summary": "Sync Silo watch history, watchlists, favorites, and ratings with MDBList.",
      "description_markdown": "Imports and exports movie and episode watch history, imports resume progress, syncs the MDBList watchlist in its own order, can keep movie and series favorites in a private MDBList list named Silo Favorites when Sync favorites is turned on, syncs movie and series ratings in both directions, and forwards live playback start, pause, and stop events.",
      "setup_markdown": "Each Silo profile connects with its own MDBList API key, created on the API page of your [MDBList preferences](https://mdblist.com/preferences/#api). The plugin needs no server-wide settings.\n\nMDBList's free tier allows 1,000 requests a day. The plugin paces requests to about one a second per key, and when MDBList reports the limit, Silo waits before the next sync.",
